      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s time for American exceptionalism to make a comeback. That starts in Ohio next year.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2045309123877826995",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T01:11:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Lower costs. Bigger paychecks. Better schools. A revival of the American Dream.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2045307166266143021",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T01:03:23+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ask yourself how many thousands more in taxes you would have paid this week without last year\u2019s tax cuts. Ask yourself what gas prices would be if we hadn\u2019t drilled for more oil over the last year. This list goes on.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2045303033454841908",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-18T00:46:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The success of Ohio will include the success of *every* part of Ohio. We\u2019re going to bring an economic boom to Pike County, thanks for the warm welcome tonight!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044927457611202976",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-16T23:54:33+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Time to end government waste, fraud, &amp; abuse - and put that wasted money back in the hands of law-abiding citizens where it belongs.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044920795701694885",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-16T23:28:05+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is why I\u2019m doing it.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044827071177019783",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-16T17:15:39+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Grateful for prayers from God\u2019s people of all faiths across our state. \ud83d\ude4f \ud83d\ude4f\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044785395196698636",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-16T14:30:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019re going to win Trumbull County &amp; we\u2019ll never forget the Mahoning Valley. Thanks for the warm welcome tonight. \ud83d\ude4f",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044586583790432456",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-16T01:20:02+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Fun pop-in to Cassese\u2019s MVR in Youngstown. Great people, great food, and a great family-owned business.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044562813625291143",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T23:45:35+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Productive meeting with law enforcement officials &amp; leaders from the Fraternal Order of Police at the Mahoning County Sheriff\u2019s Office today. We back the blue, and we\u2019ll restore law &amp; order in cities across Ohio. \ud83d\udcaa\ud83c\udffc",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044556023168700479",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T23:18:36+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We\u2019re going to put Ohio at the top of this list after I\u2019m elected.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044532792357491143",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T21:46:17+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is why I\u2019m doing it.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044424625820758221",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T14:36:29+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ohio can\u2019t afford to trust Amy Acton again. She owes our state an apology.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044243702231773319",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T02:37:33+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There would have never been a First Amendment, without the Second Amendment. Tonight I explained why.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044237310720651352",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T02:12:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Honored to receive the endorsement today from the Buckeye Firearms Association, representing gun owners across Ohio. We will always stand for the Second Amendment. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044225671027929230",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-15T01:25:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The government we elect is the government we deserve.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044138912931819748",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-14T19:41:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The Second Amendment isn\u2019t a suggestion, it\u2019s a right. And it\u2019s the one that secures all the others.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2044085192667832483",
